able fit</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-800 leading-snug\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span class=\"\">Excellent wind noise reduction</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-800 leading-snug\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span class=\"\">Smart &quot;Speak-to-Chat&quot;</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-rose-50 rounded-xl p-4 border border-rose-100\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-rose-900 text-sm mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-x w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m15 9-6 6\"></path><path d=\"m9 9 6 6\"></path></svg> Watch Out</h3><ul class=\"space-y-1\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-800 leading-snug\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-x w-4 h-4 text-rose-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m15 9-6 6\"></path><path d=\"m9 9 6 6\"></path></svg><span>Battery stability complaints</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-800 leading-snug\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-x w-4 h-4 text-rose-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m15 9-6 6\"></path><path d=\"m9 9 6 6\"></path></svg><span>Foam tips wear out quickly</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-800 leading-snug\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-x w-4 h-4 text-rose-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m15 9-6 6\"></path><path d=\"m9 9 6 6\"></path></svg><span>Expensive</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"mb-4 p-4 bg-slate-100 rounded-xl border border-slate-300 border-l-4 border-l-slate-600\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-info w-3 h-3 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-primary uppercase tracking-widest\">Why we picked this</h3></div><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-900 font-semibold leading-relaxed italic\">&quot;<!-- -->Selected as the top choice for audiophiles, these earbuds deliver industry-leading sound clarity and Hi-Res Audio support that silences the noisy Dubai commute better than anything else.<!-- -->&quot;</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-50 to-orange-50 border-t border-amber-200 p-5\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-0.5 w-full sm:w-auto text-center sm:text-left\"><span class=\"text-[14px] font-black text-gray-800 uppercase tracking-tight flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-tag w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12.586 2.586A2 2 0 0 0 11.172 2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7.172a2 2 0 0 0 .586 1.414l8.704 8.704a2.426 2.426 0 0 0 3.42 0l6.58-6.58a2.426 2.426 0 0 0 0-3.42z\"></path><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg>Approx. Price:</span><span class=\"text-2xl font-black text-emerald-700 tracking-tight\">AED 679</span></div><div class=\"w-full sm:w-auto transform transition-transform hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 duration-200\"><a href=\"https://amzn.to/4p346Gh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 w-full sm:w-auto bg-yellow-400 hover:bg-yellow-500 text-black font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-lg shadow-sm text-center transition-colors\">Check Price on <!-- -->Amazon.ae<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></article><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center py-2