swer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes, brands like Soundcore (Anker) are known for reliability. While the battery might degrade slightly faster than a premium Sony pair over 3 years, they offer incredible value. Avoid unbranded \\\\\\\"AED 30\\\\\\\" earbuds as they often fail within weeks.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Can I use these for gym and running?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes, but check the IP rating. The TOZO T10 (IPX8) and Soundcore P20i (IPX5) are safest for heavy sweat. The UGREEN ClipBuds are the safest for outdoor running as they let you hear traffic.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"What is the difference between the UAE Version and Global Version?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"For brands like Sony and Samsung, the UAE Version ensures you have a valid local warranty. Global versions (often cheaper) are \\\\\\\"grey imports\\\\\\\" and may be rejected by local service centers if they need repairs.\\\"}}]}]}\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"20:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",null,{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$2a\\\"}}],\\\"$L2b\\\"]\\n22:null\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"26:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"10 Best Wireless Earbuds in UAE for 2026 – Top Picks for... | TopTenUAE\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Wireless earbuds have evolved from simple audio accessories into essential everyday companions for life in the UAE. Whether you’re taking Zoom calls from...\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"application-name\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"TopTenUAE\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"manifest\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/manifest.json\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\