489861\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"span\\\",\\\"marks\\\":[\\\"strong\\\"],\\\"text\\\":\\\"Open-Ear (UGREEN ClipBuds):\\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"15b5c8fc8f67\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"span\\\",\\\"marks\\\":[],\\\"text\\\":\\\" Best for safety (hearing traffic) and comfort, as nothing enters your ear canal. However, bass impact is significantly lower.\\\"}],\\\"level\\\":1,\\\"listItem\\\":\\\"bullet\\\",\\\"markDefs\\\":[],\\\"style\\\":\\\"normal\\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"ad70018a9da2\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"block\\\",\\\"children\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"9b1a56f3e48b\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"span\\\",\\\"marks\\\":[],\\\"text\\\":\\\"Prefer over-ear comfort for long flights? Check out our dedicated ranking of the \\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"47e637946a70\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"span\\\",\\\"marks\\\":[\\\"strong\\\",\\\"699423a40a4d\\\"],\\\"text\\\":\\\"Best Noise-Cancelling Headphones in UAE 2026\\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"140c4f0dd11e\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"span\\\",\\\"marks\\\":[],\\\"text\\\":\\\".\\\"}],\\\"markDefs\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"699423a40a4d\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"link\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/top-ten/best-noise-cancelling-headphones-uae/\\\"}],\\\"style\\\":\\\"blockquote\\\"}],\\\"faqs\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"125b74e0f549\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"94a4db986107\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"block\\\",\\\"children\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"7384eef6e486\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"span\\\",\\\"marks\\\":[],\\\"text\\\":\\\"The Samsung Galaxy Buds3 Pro and Apple AirPods Pro 3 have the best microphones for cutting out wind and background noise. For a budget option, the Soundcore P20i uses AI to clear up your voice surprisingly well.\\\"}],\\\"markDefs\\\":[],\\\"style\\\":\\\"normal\\\"}],\\\"question\\\":\\\"Which wireless earbuds are best for making calls in Dubai?\\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"5ef08544aece\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"19e28517cc44\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"block\\\",\\\"children\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"a173503c919e\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"span\\\",\\\"marks\\\":[],\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes, brands like Soundcore (Anker) are known for reliability. While the battery might degrade slightly faster than a premium Sony pair over 3 years, they offer incredible value. Avoid unbranded \\\\\\\"AED 30\\\\\\\" earbuds as they often fail within weeks.\\\"}],\\\"markDefs\\\":[],\\\"style\\\":\\\"normal\\\"}],\\\"question\\\":\\\"Do cheap earbuds like Xiaomi or soundcore last long?\\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"b75e8564ac7f\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"f624b5eedd1b\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"block\\\",\\\"children\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"9cbade8e09b5\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"span\\\",\\\"marks\\\":[],\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes, but check the IP rating. The TOZO T10 (IPX8) and Soundcore P20i (IPX5) are safest for heavy sweat. The UGREEN ClipBuds are the safest for outdoor running as they let you hear traffic.\\\"}],\\\"markDefs\\\":[],\\\"style\\\":\\\"normal\\\"}],\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can I use these for gym and running?\\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"636af88bc8b9\\\",\\\"answer\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"3a24ff0838ba\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"block\\\",\\\"children\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"0d351b822d84\\\",\\\"_type\\\":\\\"span\\\",\\\"marks\\\":[],\\\"text\\\":\\\"For brands like Sony and Samsung, the UAE Version ensures you have a valid local warranty. Global versions (often cheaper) are \\\\\\\"grey imports\\\\\\\" and may be rejected by local service centers if they need repairs.\\\"}],\\\"markDefs\\\":[],\\\"style\\\":\\\"normal\\\"}],\\\"question\\\":\\\"What is the difference between the UAE Version and Global Version?\\\"}],\\\"intro\\\":\\\"Wireless earbuds have evolved from simple audio accessories into essential everyday companions for life in the UAE. Whether you’re taking Zoom calls from a busy Dubai café, pushing through workouts...\\\",\\\"listItems\\\":[{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"99c96639a3f0\\\",\\\"badgeLabel\\\":\\\"Best Value for Money\\\",\\\"customVerdict\\\":null,\\\"product\\\":{\\\"_type\\\":\\\"product\\\",\\\"address\\\":null,\\\"affiliateLink\\\":\\\"https://amzn.to/48QApU3\\\",\\\"availability\\\":\\\"https://schema.org/InStock\\\",\\\"brand\\\":\\\"soundcore Anker \\\",\\\"code\\\":null,\\\"cons\\\":[\\\"No Active Noise Cancellation (ANC)\\\",\\\"Microphone struggles in wind\\\",\\\"Plastic build feels cheap\\\"],\\\"country\\\":null,\\\"currency\\\":\\\"AED\\\",\\\"curriculum\\\":null,\\\"customerRating\\\":4.2,\\\"entityType\\\":null,\\\"feeRange\\\":null,\\\"heroFeature\\\":null,\\\"keyFeatures\\\":[\\\"10mm Drivers with Big Bass\\\",\\\"30H Total Playtime\\\",\\\"IPX5 Water Resistant\\\",\\\"AI-Enhanced Calls (2 Mics)\\\",\\\"App Control (22 EQs)\\\"],\\\"location\\\":null,\\\"mainImage\\\":{\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Soundcore by Anker P20i wireless earbuds in black displayed with a matching charging case and attached braided lanyard.\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kxdjzy8e/production/886d391c1a9caa3f5e86a80fc81de8f9d73cd1b2-1251x1500.jpg\\\"},\\\"price\\\":59,\\\"priceTier\\\":\\\"Budget\\\",\\\"pros\\\":[\\\"Incredible price point\\\",\\\"\\\\\\\"Find My Earbuds\\\\\\\" feature\\\",\\\"Compact case with lanyard\\\",\\\"Punchy bass for the size\\\"],\\\"rating\\\":4.2,\\\"realityCheck\\\":null,\\\"retailer\\\":\\\"Amazon.ae\\\",\\\"reviewCount\\\":88888,\\\"slug\\\":\\\"soundcore-anker-p20i-earbuds\\\",\\\"specifications\\\":null,\\\"title\\\":\\\"soundcore Anker P20i True Wireless Earbuds\\\",\\\"verdict\\\":\\\"The undisputed king of budget earbuds in the UAE. For under AED 70, you get app support, decent bass, and a lanyard-equipped case. Perfect for daily commuting if you don't want to risk expensive gear.\\\",\\\"website\\\":null},\\\"rank\\\":1,\\\"whySelected\\\":\\\"We chose this as the #1 budget wireless earbud because it offers unheard-of value under AED 70, featuring powerful bass and rare app customization that outperforms many expensive rivals.\\\"},{\\\"_key\\\":\\\"c634c9ed0018\\\",\\\"badgeLabel\\\":\\\"The Audiophile Choice\\\",\\\"customVerdict\\\":null,\\\"product\\\":{\\\"_type\\\":\\\"product\